Mockup Description for Saved Places Screen (Version 1 – Basic Layout)

This is a basic wireframe of the Saved Places Screen for Travel Map Discovery App.

Layout:

Top: Screen title “Saved Places”
Center: List of saved locations with image and name
Bottom: Scrollable list

Hierarchy:

Primary: List of saved places
Secondary: Navigation bar (persistent at bottom)

Usability:

Simple scrolling list
Easy to open place details from list
Clean, minimal layout